<title>GERMANY: German Mar producer prices flat m/m, +0.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German Mar producer prices flat m/m, +0.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES   Mar 97	Feb 97	 Mar 96</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  unch	   -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +0.7	  +0.6	   -0.3</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  104.1	 104.1	  103.4</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    -0.1	  unch	   -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +0.6	  +0.6	   -0.5</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.6	 103.7	  103.0</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    -0.1	  unch	   +0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.5	  +1.7	   +1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  109.7	 109.8	  108.1</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
